sm_tufnlMykQ7kNvwE5RPu9&_nc_oc=AdqU_EyANge6Nw_3YJYGNzGhtWC7o7IHvYCe4TpwTF5-rqBRu99HE41v2pAWoWmYVFo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0QhlE2gnn6zyIOzsiGWSIgL8FDkiAkbeKFFxP4b6e9CA&oe=69DCFA37"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6GD9M3yF-I0Q7kNvwEeZejE&_nc_oc=AdrJjOfACNp7mWq9zJK6Fx7FAWoBGdqki8P9_-S5XcxZ878ABSLsfc6c9nHclUWw_xw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0AN8ZSOPb_81iNbMAH_QIj7wzBjZ_6MWtIlvgKrGeTKA&oe=69DCFBCA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qEu7XCGEuckQ7kNvwEl7PB1&_nc_oc=AdplVAAAUCQe7gGUeT46mc45rlDRQI4V4RnF1ABMoUI-np9nL4aIsvPdsRn_BPMAIBQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3VxxnXyJKyOWJrlrlid3XfPkeQ7KK9vW4HXSGSTmU11A&oe=69DCE8EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ehisj_kBf6AQ7kNvwGcPgeq&_nc_oc=AdoCOuqiP9_41cN-6xibRCMDNpdSJnpMlt-5qYkjRm_0BJsDfL2V_1Z1B6LQ4nA5jmY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1seA8d4FV1SqGrCAGkZFmRVYMWuWl2LAl5kgRJMHX8PA&oe=69DCD243"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r7rrJ9WP80MQ7kNvwHkHPnP&_nc_oc=Adop2R-ikM9PLfWjm8xtHxlDqbu0znbAqLRVJHw0q7hSXEpD4EG8A5j4MZjj9UCEk7s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0TLK1UTUe_22qQGhGwfFd5Jwp5W26p7d3tqckzGuJ6Ww&oe=69DCCA98"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KF92eToKxC8Q7kNvwG_pCYi&_nc_oc=AdoOMO2AnFQh2-c6bup5Av-S-ki1Ku37-rIe0oa48OHbJrwkShcnx_Zz9dsRcA18J_8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1Wvwut4HFroWoxaCruia36eRSGOBPb5KCEnAdbNILagA&oe=69DCDDBC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080